==============================================================================
DATASET NOTICE & TERMS
==============================================================================

The Country-Level Social Cost of Carbon (CSCC) dataset provided in this repository
(derived from cscc_db_v2.csv) is the work of:

  Katharine Ricke, Laurent Drouet, Ken Caldeira, and Massimo Tavoni
  "Country-level social cost of carbon"
  Nature Climate Change 8, 895–900 (2018)
  DOI: https://doi.org/10.1038/s41558-018-0282-y
  Original repository: https://github.com/country-level-scc/

The underlying dataset was published as academic replication and supplementary
research material without an explicit open-source license attached by the original
authors.

The MIT license above applies exclusively to the source code, parser tooling,
build scripts, and client libraries created in this repository.

The dataset itself is distributed in good faith for academic, scientific, and
educational research under academic replication principles. If you use this data,
you must properly cite the original publication listed above. If you intend to use
the data for commercial purposes, please contact the original authors directly.
